{"series":{"id":"shape-wind-siam-era","slug":"shape-wind-siam-era","title":"Shape Wind Siam Era","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-03/tshban.png?itok=SumSH9ru","synopsis":"El precursor de la tormenta está a punto de sacudir todo el Continente del Viento. Una boda con mucha información privilegiada ha atraído a personas de todos los ámbitos de la vida, convirtiendo a la ciudad de Xianluo en un campo de lucha para que las siete sectas principales luchen entre sí. El ambicioso Lancelot, el destacado espadachín Hanajiro, el misterioso y sabio Kogoro, y el cielo y la tierra Yuxue que pescan en el agua fangosa, cabalgan esta corriente subterránea, ya sea intencionalmente o no, por el destino, se reúnen en Xianluo y juntos parten. el continente del viento espantoso, de las olas gigantescas","status":"En Emisión","year":2022,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/shape-wind-siam-era"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:49:03.152Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"shape-wind-siam-era-t1","slug":"shape-wind-siam-era-t1","seriesId":"shape-wind-siam-era","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-03/tshban.png?itok=SumSH9ru","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:49:03.152Z","episodeCount":20}],"episodes":[{"id":"shape-wind-siam-era-t1-e20","slug":"shape-wind-siam-era-t1-e20","title":"shape-wind-siam-era-1-episodio-x20","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/shape-wind-siam-era-1-episodio-x20","servers":[{"name":"ok.ru","url":"https://ok.ru/videoembed/4296015612634","embed":true}],"seriesId":"shape-wind-siam-era","seasonId":"shape-wind-siam-era-t1","number":20,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:07:49.245Z"},{"id":"shape-wind-siam-era-t1-e19","slug":"shape-wind-siam-era-t1-e19","title":"shape-wind-siam-era-1-episodio-x19","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/shape-wind-siam-era-1-episodio-x19","servers":[{"name":"ok.ru","url":"https://ok.ru/videoembed